      "notes": "Imagem: File:-2019-11-06 Recycling waste bins, Northrepps Village Hall, School Lane, Northrepps.JPG — \n\n\n\nKolforn (Kolforn)\nI'd appreciate if you could mail me (Kolforn@gmail.com) if you want to use this picture out of the Wikimedia project scope.\n\n\n\n This file is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 4.0 International license.\nYou are free:\nto share – to copy, distribute and transmit the work\nto remix – to adapt the work\nUnder the following conditions:\nattribution – You must give appropriate credit, provide a link to the license, and indicate if changes were made. You may do so in any reasonable manner, but not in any way that suggests the licensor endorses you or your use.\nshare alike – If you remix, transform, or build upon the material, you must distribute your contributions under the same or compatible license as the original.https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0CC BY-SA 4.0 Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 4.0 truetrue — CC BY-SA 4.0\nhttps://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:-2019-11-06_Recycling_waste_bins,_Northrepps_Village_Hall,_School_Lane,_Northrepps.JPG\nhttps://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0\n\nAbra com a ideia de utilidade prática, não com teoria ambiental. Mostre que o hábito vale tanto no lixo doméstico quanto na coleta seletiva escolar. Evite prometer solução total; o foco é começar com organização simples."
